.TH MYSTRNCPY 3 "September 2026" "libmyutils 1.0" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrncpy \- copy up to n characters of a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int mystrncpy(char *" dest ", const char *" src ", int " n ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mystrncpy()
function copies at most
.I n
characters from the string
.I src
into
.I dest.
If
.I src
is shorter than
.I n,
the remainder of
.I dest
is unspecified beyond the copied characters.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the number of characters copied on success, or a negative value on failure.
